  "bodyHash": "e704c8fc8a383653",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心制作。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">当前游戏音乐轨道是一个客户端模组，它会在 GUI 中显示当前正在播放的歌曲。你可以确切知道歌曲的标题，并确定你的最爱！每当音乐开始时，标题会在选中物品名称上方淡入。6秒后，它将再次淡出。位置、持续时间、颜色和行为规范均可配置。请参阅下方的 GIF 图片，以更好地了解其外观。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含在 The Vanilla Experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum&#x27;s Client Bundle 中\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"环境：客户端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>durationTitleShownInTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 80，最小值 0，最大值 1200</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">音乐轨道标题在屏幕上可见的时间长度。20 tick = 1 秒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>titleShouldFadeIn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">音乐轨道标题是否应淡入。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>titleShouldFadeOut</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">音乐轨道标题是否应淡出。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>musicGUIPositionIsLeft</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">将 GUI 音乐显示在左侧。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>musicGUIPositionIsCenter</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">将 GUI 音乐显示在中间。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>musicGUIPositionIsRight</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">将 GUI 音乐显示在右侧。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>musicGUIBottomHeightOffset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 72，最小值 0，最大值 3000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">音乐 GUI 的垂直偏移量（y 坐标）。这决定了文本在屏幕上的高度位置。可以更改以防止 GUI 重叠。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>musicGUIWidthOffset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0，最小值 -3000，最大值 3000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">音乐 GUI 的水平偏移量（x 坐标）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>drawTextShadow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">显示的文本下方是否绘制阴影。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_R</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 13，最小值 0，最大值 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">音乐 GUI 文本的红色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_G</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 120，最小值 0，最大值 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">音乐 GUI 文本的绿色 RGB 值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_B</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 26，最小值 0，最大值 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">音乐 GUI 文本的蓝色 RGB 值。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>显示 <em>繁茂洞穴</em> 音乐轨道：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/current-game-music-track/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>显示 <em>创造模式</em> 音乐轨道：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/current-game-music-track/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内，您就可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在如此多的独立模组页面中跟踪评论，因此已禁用评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或任何其他内容，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
